          "text": "🚨 PENN STATE: Preliminary hearings are underway for suspects accused in an alleged cocaine distribution ring tied to Penn State fraternities.\n\nProsecutors say cocaine was sourced from Philadelphia and New York, then allegedly cut and packaged at the Delta Upsilon and Sigma Chi houses, with some fraternity pledges reportedly used to help with the operation.\n\nPennsylvania Attorney General Dave Sunday has described the alleged network as organized and highly profitable. Penn State suspended the fraternities while the investigation continues. https://t.co/IIwEeqPfw0"
